# /etc/systemd/system/kbo-update.timer  (매일 07:00 KST 갱신)
# 설치: sudo cp deploy/kbo-update.* /etc/systemd/system/ && sudo systemctl daemon-reload
#       sudo systemctl enable --now kbo-update.timer
[Unit]
Description=Run KBO data update daily

[Timer]
OnCalendar=*-*-* 07:00:00
Persistent=true

[Install]
WantedBy=timers.target
